DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19599::$$$message_0214_0000_0000$$$::"The hell?[lr]::
19600::$$$message_0214_0000_0001$$$::Oi, the hot springs are in the mountains. What are we going to the temple for?"::
19601::$$$message_0214_0000_0002$$$::"The hot springs are important, but there is something I must attend to here."::
19602::$$$message_0214_0000_0003$$$::"Terminate your next opponent with extreme prejudice, Lancer, Archer."::
19603::$$$message_0214_0001_0000$$$::[hfu][cm]"[hfl]"[hfu]?[hfl]?[hfu]?[hfl]?[hfu]"[hfl]"::
19604::$$$message_0214_0001_0001$$$::"Is there a problem?"::
19605::$$$message_0214_0001_0002$$$::"Well, you being batshit crazy is nothing new, so I won't pry.[lr]::
19606::$$$message_0214_0001_0003$$$::But what's so special about this one?"::
19607::$$$message_0214_0001_0004$$$::"It's just that they've looked so terribly happy lately."::
19608::$$$message_0214_0001_0005$$$::"Ahh, so that's it.[lr]::
41713::$$$message_0214_0001_0006$$$::...Good grief, you truly are a devil."::
41714::$$$message_0214_0002_0000$$$::"Souichirou... Are you going to work even on your day off...?"::
41715::$$$message_0214_0002_0001$$$::"Yes. The principal asked me to fill in during winter break."::
41716::$$$message_0214_0002_0002$$$::"I-[wait canskip=0 time=300]I see... [wait canskip=0 time=200][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=喜 layer=0 time=200]Yes, [hfsweat layer=0]I understand, of course! [hfwww leyer=0]I'm not against it. I'm a good wife, after all!"::
41717::$$$message_0214_0002_0003$$$::"If your workplace needs you, then I should support you [hfchance layer=0]as your wife... [wait canskip=0 time=300][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=哀 layer=0 time=200][hfsigh layer=0]I should...[wait canskip=0 time=500][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=哀2 layer=0 time=200][se storage=se422.wav][hfangry layer=0] Waaaaahhhhh!"::
41718::$$$message_0214_0002_0004$$$::"..."::
41719::$$$message_0214_0002_0005$$$::"Hm, hm. Caster's grown a bit."::
41720::$$$message_0214_0002_0006$$$::"Last summer, she would've been tempted to lay waste to the school, but look how calm she is now. I think this might end in her merely cursing the principal, Souichirou."::
41721::$$$message_0214_0002_0007$$$::"...[lr]::
41722::$$$message_0214_0002_0008$$$::Yes, maybe I'll do that now."::
41723::$$$message_0214_0002_0009$$$::"Watch this, Master. I learned a few Japanese-style curses recently."::
41724::$$$message_0214_0002_0010$$$::"First, you take a straw effigy and inscribe [se storage=se048.wav][se storage=se313.wav]your impudent target's name on it..."::
41725::$$$message_0214_0002_0011$$$::"Hm? Well, you don't see that every day.[lr]::
41726::$$$message_0214_0002_0012$$$::Souichirou, it appears your principal and I share the same[line len=2]"::
41727::$$$message_0214_0002_0013$$$::"All finished.[lr]::
41728::$$$message_0214_0002_0014$$$::Voila, [wait canskip=0 time=200][hffacechg chara=キャスター face=やっておしまい layer=0 time=200][se storage=se041.wav][se storage=se150.wav][se storage=se265.wav][hfstamp layer=0]divine punishment."::
41729::$$$message_0214_0002_0015$$$::"It's Tsuda Kojirou!"[nolr]::
41730::$$$message_0214_0002_0016$$$::"Oh, my mistake. I've mastered Japanese curses, but my grasp of your language could still use some work. I missed one character."[nolr]::
41731::$$$message_0214_0002_0017$$$::"...Caster. I wasn't finished speaking.[lr]::
41732::$$$message_0214_0002_0018$$$::While it was a rare invitation, I declined."::
41733::$$$message_0214_0002_0019$$$::"Eh? Souichirou...?"::
41734::$$$message_0214_0002_0020$$$::"I turned the principal down.[lr]::
41735::$$$message_0214_0002_0021$$$::Few students visit the school during the new year. They can do without me."::
41736::$$$message_0214_0002_0022$$$::"I have permission to go on leave."::
41737::$$$message_0214_0003_0000$$$::"When I told the principal that I wanted to spend time with my wife, he recommended a resort we could stay at."::
41738::$$$message_0214_0003_0001$$$::"We'll be traveling to Hokuriku. That isn't a problem, I take it?"::
41739::$$$message_0214_0003_0002$$$::"N-no, not at all![wait canskip=0 time=400][lr]::
41740::$$$message_0214_0003_0003$$$::In fact, I'm ecstatic! [hfpop layer=0]Principal Goroumaru, I'm sorry for trying to curse you!"::
41741::$$$message_0214_0003_0004$$$::"Hehe, hehehe...our names...aren't the same at all..."[nolr]::
41742::$$$message_0214_0003_0005$$$::"...Wait.[lr]::
41743::$$$message_0214_0003_0006$$$::Caster, outside."::
41744::$$$message_0214_0003_0007$$$::"...![lr]::
41745::$$$message_0214_0003_0008$$$::(Way to spoil the mood! What's this spooky, gloomy aura that's ruining the moment!?)"::
41746::$$$message_0214_0003_0009$$$::"Who's there!?[lr]::
41747::$$$message_0214_0003_0010$$$::The newspaper delivery already came today!"[nolr]::
41748::$$$message_0214_0004_0000$$$::"My name is hardly worthy of introductions.[lr]::
41749::$$$message_0214_0004_0001$$$::If I had to say, I'm simply an ordinary debt collector, here to collect my due on your happiness."::
41750::$$$message_0214_0005_0000$$$::"Now, Lancer, Archer...[lr]::
41751::$$$message_0214_0005_0001$$$::There's no need to hold back. Destroy them utterly."[nolr]::
41752::$$$message_0214_0006_0000$$$::"If it isn't the exorcist from the church.[lr]::
41753::$$$message_0214_0006_0001$$$::...I don't recall inviting you."::
41754::$$$message_0214_0006_0002$$$::"I believe a wraith like you, who drains the Luck of everyone merely in her presence, is well-suited to be shut away in an underground church."::
41755::$$$message_0214_0006_0003$$$::"Oh, don't be like that, Caster.[lr]::
41756::$$$message_0214_0006_0004$$$::That makes her sound positively adorable. I wouldn't call her a wraith. She's more like a li[line len=2]"::
41757::$$$message_0214_0007_0000$$$::"...How unfortunate.[lr]::
41758::$$$message_0214_0007_0001$$$::You've gone soft, Caster."::
41759::$$$message_0214_0007_0002$$$::"I can't believe you're being tempted by the happiness dangling in front of you, when there's an onsen that can grant your wish so close by.[lr]::
41760::$$$message_0214_0007_0003$$$::It's a stain on your name as a witch."::
41761::$$$message_0214_0007_0004$$$::"...Hmph. I suppose I wasn't clear enough the first time."::
41762::$$$message_0214_0007_0005$$$::"Listen, little girl. I've [hfwww layer=0]graduated from all that. You loners are free to wage that awful war amongst yourselves."::
41763::$$$message_0214_0007_0006$$$::"Besides, I no longer have anything to wish for. [hfpop layer=0]Magecraft, war...I don't need them anymore."::
41764::$$$message_0214_0007_0007$$$::"What a surprise.[lr]::
41765::$$$message_0214_0007_0008$$$::Kuzuki, does your Servant truly not use magecraft for personal gain anymore?"::
41766::$$$message_0214_0007_0009$$$::"Apparently. I haven't forbidden her from doing so, but I won't object if that's what Caster has decided for herself."::
41767::$$$message_0214_0007_0010$$$::"I see.[lr]::
41768::$$$message_0214_0007_0011$$$::[playstop time=2000 nowait=1]...Then I take it you still haven't told Kuzuki, Caster."::
41769::$$$message_0214_0007_0012$$$::"Wha...![lr]::
41770::$$$message_0214_0007_0013$$$::T-told him about what?"::
41771::$$$message_0214_0007_0014$$$::"Your credit card.[lr]::
41772::$$$message_0214_0007_0015$$$::Is completely.[lr]::
41773::$$$message_0214_0007_0016$$$::Maxed out."::
41774::$$$message_0214_0007_0017$$$::"W-w-w-what...!?"::
41775::$$$message_0214_0007_0018$$$::"How did you know about that[se storage=se251.wav]!?"::
41776::$$$message_0214_0007_0019$$$::"Well, my company owns the stores you shop at."::
41777::$$$message_0214_0007_0020$$$::"We did have a rush of new product releases this month, and you actually bought them all just because you had nothing better to do. Way to support the modeling hobby."::
41778::$$$message_0214_0007_0021$$$::"That's... That's a secret.[lr]::
41779::$$$message_0214_0007_0022$$$::I'll do whatever you want, so keep it a [wait canskip=0 time=600]secret..."::
41780::$$$message_0214_0007_0023$$$::"...You really have lost your edge, Caster.[lr]::
41781::$$$message_0214_0007_0024$$$::Do you really take me for a girl who'd just sit on such delicious gossip?"::
41782::$$$message_0214_0007_0025$$$::"Argh...! Then it looks like I'll have to silence you by force!"::
41783::$$$message_0214_0007_0026$$$::"I only need 20,000 yen to pay off my balance![lr]::
41784::$$$message_0214_0007_0027$$$::I'll be in the clear as long as I incapacitate you here!"::
41785::$$$message_0214_0007_0028$$$::"Anyone from the countryside would make the same mistake with a new credit card. Next time, I'll do better!"::
41786::$$$message_0214_0007_0029$$$::"..."::
41787::$$$message_0214_0007_0030$$$::"I think it's far too late for that now, Caster."::
41788::$$$message_0214_0007_0031$$$::"You wannabe samurai![lr]::
41789::$$$message_0214_0007_0032$$$::This is all because you didn't do your job and guard the gate!"::
41790::$$$message_0214_0007_0033$$$::"Oh, don't be like that, Major.[lr]::
41791::$$$message_0214_0007_0034$$$::I suppose an unreasonable curse struck me in the chest and hampered my duties."::
41792::$$$message_0214_0007_0035$$$::"Tch! This is the problem with handsome men...!"::
41793::$$$message_0214_0007_0036$$$::"...Fine, then. I accept your challenge, little witch-in-training."::
41794::$$$message_0214_0007_0037$$$::"Get ready for me to feed you some lethally toxic bubuzuke distilled from your repeated failures!"::

